    "reconstruction_notes": {
      "en": "Original negative-impression teaching slab with one long gently curved pair of depressed furrows and repeated bilateral oblique recessed scratches. Neutral-gray geometry must show internal relief from top and oblique views; substrate outline is not the identifier. KGS basic ichnogenus discussion consulted, whose cited specimens are mostly positive hyporelief; this is an interpretive negative display as frozen, not a copy of those specimens. Nominal0.30m slab, depths and scratch spacing are art choices. No named ichnospecies, excavated specimen, specific producer, Asaphus connection, exact motion or coexistence claim.",
      "zh": "原创凹陷教学岩板，以一条缓弯成对凹沟和双侧重复斜向凹刮痕表达。中性灰几何须在顶视及斜视显示内部浮雕，底板轮廓不作识别依据。已查KGS潜迹属基本论述，其具名标本多为底面正浮雕；本项按冻结要求作原创新的负印迹示意，不复制这些标本。0.30米名义岩板、深度及刮痕间距为美术设定。不指定种、出土标本、制造者，不绑定Asaphus，不主张精确运动或共存。"
    },
